]["][For]["][ loops][?][ You][ got][ em][,][ now][.][ What][ about][ loops][ that][ step][ through][ an][ object][?][ How][ about][ nested][ loops][?][ Learn][ how][ to][ break][ out][ of][ a][ loop][,][ too][ -][ helpful][ to][ avoid][ killing][ Flash][!][
